[1.36,"o","unstale reads new release notes with a model, on your own key or your Codex plan.\r\n"]
[1.42,"o","None is set up here (Codex is not logged in).\r\n"]
[1.48,"o","\r\n"]
[1.54,"o","  1  Set one up   shows the one line to add\r\n"]
[1.6,"o","  2  Not now      free · advisories and deprecations only, ≈ 27% of the changes in new releases\r\n"]
[1.66,"o","\r\n"]
[1.72,"o","Enter for 1, or 2:\r\n"]
[1.78,"o","\r\n"]
[1.84,"o","Add one of these lines to your shell profile or this repo's .env, then run `unstale setup`:\r\n"]
[1.9,"o","\r\n"]
